{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15f0bc989c9d340f7d59d1b0aa6fc579059e09bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\log_{2} (x-1) = 1 - \\log_{2}(x+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"243\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The left part of the equation can be simplified to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c8a7313cc3f726836144d829f7c4cd1d785d4b3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1 - \\log_{2}(x+2)) = (\\log_{2}(x-1)^2)\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/2/0e22b331aa46d935f74a3bdd3ceaaa9df7814795.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{2}(x-1)^2 + \\log_{2} (x+2) = 1\\]\" width=\"235\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/414867a5b0dc28baf080e76a1fcd5810b725638f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{2}((x-1)^2(x+2)) = 1\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e171c337621d43040118964519225aec2b11c5c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[((x-1)^2(x+2)) = 2\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p>Expand the equation, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f371f4d27bd5fed1d8ed404dbc8b62217a23d9e8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^3 - 3x + 2) = 2\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f345891075f0497d194ce4a49277e4190d4691.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^3 -3x) = 0\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc73207728ade0118da53429de9680972929ea6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(x^2 -3) = 0\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/6/e8646e022121b458d09972c680a5970825864712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/6452c212d5a824a2c7177c58f3b58274f01fec3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- \\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>However, when we plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/0/910e307b8e55975f0e5fd4ed307afd04b28e9d00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> back to the left side of the equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8bf5c9e6df6533e3893b9784f9c89d05ff2adf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_{2}(x-1)^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"21\" /> turns out to be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is not acceptable for logarithms.\n</p><p>Therefore, the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e769db3b4b0b744edb36b4489a92e4b98230f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x=\\sqrt3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p><p>~Minor changes by Baihly2024\n</p><p>~Minor changes by Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uQzjgxEEQ74\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uQzjgxEEQ74</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018010959\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3201/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.760      1 2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\n100.00%    6.760      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35928:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018010959 and revision id 279256. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}